| HTTP Method | Route                         | Description                                            | Role Required | Request Body                 | Expected Response                                                                                             |
| ----------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| GET         | `/api/users/profile`          | Retrieves the profile of the currently logged-in user. | Any           | None                         | **200 OK** with profile; **401 Unauthorized** if not logged in.                                               |
| PUT         | `/api/users/profile`          | Updates the logged-in user's personal information.     | Any           | FirstName, LastName, Phone   | **200 OK** with updated profile; **400 Bad Request** for invalid data; **401 Unauthorized** if not logged in. |
| PUT         | `/api/users/profile/password` | Changes the logged-in user's password.                 | Any           | CurrentPassword, NewPassword | **200 OK**; **400 Bad Request** for invalid password; **401 Unauthorized** for invalid authentication.        |
| POST        | `/api/users/profile/picture`  | Updates the user's profile picture reference.          | Any           | Image file / image URL       | **200 OK** with updated profile picture URL; **400 Bad Request** for invalid file.                            |
